SEL: default passwords now depend on the relay's model family, from the tables in the SEL instruction manuals (e.g. ``Sel-1`` for level C on 400 series relays, no level B on 700 series relays), in the new ``peat.modules.sel.sel_default_creds``. Configured credentials always win. At most 4 default FTP logins are tried, anonymous FTP is only tried if the relay's settings enable it, web logins only try the ``acc`` and ``2ac`` levels, and ``CLARKE`` is only tried for level C on 400 series relays if ``sel.cal_clarke_fallback`` is enabled.
